#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span id="first-analysis-prompt" >
#. {ph3}: <span translate="no" >https://rea.tools/examples/notes-
#. example.zip</span >
#. {ph4}: <span translate="no">notes.csv</span>
#. {ph5}: </span >
#. {ph6}: <span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph7}: </span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:302
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Download {ph3} into a new example folder and unpack it. Use "
"REA to find what happens when I click Export notes. Show where {ph4} is "
"written, which fields it contains, and the relevant files and "
"lines.{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}{ph3} একটি নতুন উদাহরণ ফোল্ডারে ডাউনলোড করে unpack করো। "
"Export notes-এ ক্লিক করলে কী হয় তা REA দিয়ে খুঁজে বের করো। {ph4} কোথায় "
"লেখা হয়, এতে কোন কোন field থাকে এবং প্রাসঙ্গিক ফাইল ও লাইনগুলো "
"দেখাও।{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:316
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Your agent downloads the files and gives the unpacked folder to REA for "
"inspection."
msgstr ""
"আপনার agent ফাইলগুলো ডাউনলোড করে unpack করা ফোল্ডারটি পরীক্ষার জন্য REA-কে "
"দেয়।"

#. {ph0}: <a class="button" href="../examples/notes-example.zip"
#. download="notes-example.zip" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:320
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Download example ZIP{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}উদাহরণের ZIP ডাউনলোড করুন{ph1}"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes-example</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:328
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"If your agent can’t download files, unzip this archive yourself. Give it the"
" path to the {ph0} folder and the same export question."
msgstr ""
"আপনার agent ফাইল ডাউনলোড করতে না পারলে archive-টি নিজেই unzip করুন। তাকে "
"{ph0} ফোল্ডারের path এবং export নিয়ে একই প্রশ্নটি দিন।"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:335
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "3. Follow the answer back to the code"
msgstr "3. উত্তর ধরে কোড পর্যন্ত যান"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:336
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Look for a short explanation with file and line references:"
msgstr "ফাইল ও লাইনের reference-সহ একটি সংক্ষিপ্ত ব্যাখ্যা খুঁজুন:"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes:export</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>notes.csv</code>
#. {ph2}: <code>id</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>title</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:338
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The button sends a {ph0} message. The main process formats the notes as CSV "
"and writes {ph1} in the user’s Downloads folder. The columns are {ph2} and "
"{ph3}."
msgstr ""
"বাটনটি একটি {ph0} message পাঠায়। Main process নোটগুলোকে CSV আকারে সাজিয়ে "
"ব্যবহারকারীর Downloads ফোল্ডারে {ph1} লেখে। কলামগুলো হলো {ph2} ও {ph3}।"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:346
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "From the button to the file writer"
msgstr "বাটন থেকে file writer পর্যন্ত"

