#. {ph8}: </span >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:364
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Handler · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}Write {ph4}{ph5}{ph6}Calls the formatter in "
"{ph7} and writes the file.{ph8}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Handler · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4} লেখে{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}-এর formatter call "
"করে ফাইলটি লেখে।{ph8}"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:375
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA’s static analysis pairs the message with its handler. The destination is"
" read from code."
msgstr ""
"REA-এর static analysis message-টিকে তার handler-এর সঙ্গে জোড়া মেলায়। "
"গন্তব্যটি কোড থেকে পড়া হয়।"

#. {ph0}: <span translate="no">main.js</span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:382
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0} · lines 8–12"
msgstr "{ph0} · লাইন 8–12"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:383
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Source"
msgstr "সোর্স"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:391
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The file path, formatter and write call are together in this handler. Ask "
"your agent to show these lines if its answer leaves them out."
msgstr ""
"ফাইলের path, formatter ও write call এই handler-এ একসঙ্গে আছে। আপনার agent-এর"
" উত্তরে এই লাইনগুলো না থাকলে দেখাতে বলুন।"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/javascript/#follow" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:396
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}See the full code trace and recorded REA result{ph1}."
msgstr "{ph0}পূর্ণ কোড trace এবং রেকর্ড করা REA ফলাফল দেখুন{ph1}।"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:403
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "4. Check a prediction"
msgstr "4. একটি অনুমান যাচাই করুন"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:404
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"A comma separates CSV columns. What happens when a note title itself "
"contains a comma or quotation marks?"
msgstr ""
"CSV-তে কমা দিয়ে কলাম আলাদা করা হয়। নোটের শিরোনামেই যদি কমা বা উদ্ধৃতিচিহ্ন"
" থাকে, তাহলে কী হয়?"

#. {ph0}: <span class="prompt-symbol" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span id="first-check-prompt" >
#. {ph3}: <span translate="no">Hello, "REA"</span>
#. {ph4}: <span translate="no">toCsv</span>
#. {ph5}: <span translate="no">Node.js</span>
#. {ph6}: </span >
#. {ph7}: <span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph8}: </span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:424
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Predict the CSV for a note with id 1 and title {ph3}. Then "
"run the example’s {ph4} formatter with {ph5} to check it. Show the "
"prediction and actual output.{ph6}{ph7}{ph8}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}id 1 এবং শিরোনাম {ph3}-যুক্ত একটি নোটের CSV কেমন হবে অনুমান "
"করো। তারপর যাচাই করতে {ph5} দিয়ে উদাহরণের {ph4} formatter চালাও। অনুমান এবং"
" আসল output দুটোই দেখাও।{ph6}{ph7}{ph8}"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:437
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Expected formatter output"
msgstr "Formatter-এর প্রত্যাশিত output"

#. {ph0}: <span translate="no">Node.js</span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:442
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The title stays in one quoted field; each quotation mark is doubled. This "
"checks the formatter directly with {ph0}."
msgstr ""
"শিরোনামটি উদ্ধৃতিচিহ্নে ঘেরা একটি field-এই থাকে; প্রতিটি উদ্ধৃতিচিহ্ন "
"দ্বিগুণ হয়। এটি {ph0} দিয়ে সরাসরি formatter যাচাই করে।"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:448
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Run the check yourself"
msgstr "যাচাইটি নিজে চালান"

