#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}How Notion copies text and HTML{ph1}{ph2}Follow a clipboard feature in "
"a packaged Electron app.{ph3}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Notion কীভাবে টেক্সট ও HTML কপি করে{ph1}{ph2}একটি packaged Electron "
"অ্যাপে clipboard ফিচার অনুসরণ করুন।{ph3}"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../showcase/dx-ball/" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <span >
#. {ph3}: </span >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:509
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}How DX-Ball calculates sound panning{ph1}{ph2}Read the original "
"instructions and the reconstruction’s checks.{ph3}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}DX-Ball কীভাবে sound panning হিসাব করে{ph1}{ph2}মূল instruction এবং "
"পুনর্গঠনের যাচাইগুলো পড়ুন।{ph3}"

