#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:234
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid "The CSV export across Electron processes"
msgstr "Electron process-গুলো জুড়ে CSV export"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: <code>notes.exportCsv()</code>
#. {ph4}: </span >
#. {ph5}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph6}: <code>renderer.js</code>
#. {ph7}: <code>preload.js</code>
#. {ph8}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:238
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Renderer → preload{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6} calls the API exposed "
"by {ph7}.{ph8}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Renderer → preload{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6} {ph7}-এর উন্মুক্ত করা "
"API call করে।{ph8}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: <code>notes:export</code>
#. {ph4}: </span >
#. {ph5}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph6}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:246
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Between processes{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}The preload invokes an IPC "
"channel: a named message to the main process.{ph6}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Process-গুলোর মাঝে{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}Preload একটি IPC channel "
"invoke করে: main process-এর উদ্দেশে একটি নামযুক্ত message।{ph6}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph5}: <code>main.js</code>
#. {ph6}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:254
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Main process{ph1}{ph2}An export handler{ph3}{ph4}{ph5} handles that "
"channel and calls the CSV writer.{ph6}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Main process{ph1}{ph2}একটি export handler{ph3}{ph4}{ph5} সেই channel "
"সামলায় এবং CSV writer call করে।{ph6}"

#. {ph0}: <code>csv.js</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>main.js</code>
#. {ph2}: <code>downloads/notes.csv</code>
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:263
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid "{ph0} formats the notes → {ph1} writes {ph2}."
msgstr "{ph0} নোটগুলো সাজায় → {ph1} {ph2} লেখে।"

#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:267
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA matches the literal IPC call to its handler and identifies the exposed "
"API. The path is inferred from code; a runtime capture can check what "
"executes."
