#. {ph5}: <code>320</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:550
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}03 · Subtract 500.0.{ph1} {ph2} reads the double at {ph3}. REA's byte "
"result decodes to {ph4}, shifting the calculation's center to screen "
"coordinate {ph5}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}03 · 500.0 বিয়োগ।{ph1} {ph2} {ph3}-এর double পড়ে। REA-এর byte ফলাফল "
"decode করলে {ph4} পাওয়া যায়, যা হিসাবের কেন্দ্রকে screen coordinate "
"{ph5}-এ সরিয়ে আনে।"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>FMUL</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>0x4210a0</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>dxball_pan_scale</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>1.0</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:556
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}04 · Apply the stored scale.{ph1} The second {ph2} reads {ph3}. That "
"global is named {ph4} in the maintained source. REA's second byte read "
"establishes its initial value of {ph5}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}04 · সংরক্ষিত scale প্রয়োগ।{ph1} দ্বিতীয় {ph2} {ph3} পড়ে। "
"রক্ষণাবেক্ষণকৃত source-এ এই global-এর নাম {ph4}। REA-এর দ্বিতীয় byte read "
"এর প্রাথমিক মান {ph5} নিশ্চিত করে।"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>0x406430</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>__ftol</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>DxBallInt</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:563
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}05 · Return an integer.{ph1} The call at {ph2} reaches {ph3}, "
"identified in REA's callee results. The C casts the result to {ph4}; "
"original-x86 comparisons check the returned value."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}05 · একটি integer return।{ph1} {ph2}-এর call {ph3}-এ পৌঁছায়, যা REA-এর"
" callee ফলাফলে শনাক্ত হয়েছে। C কোডে ফলাফলটি {ph4}-এ cast করা হয়; মূল "
"x86-এর সঙ্গে তুলনা ফেরত দেওয়া মানটি যাচাই করে।"

#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:572
