msgid ""
"The source names and compiler checks come from TH04 checkpoint {ph0}. "
"Earlier reconstruction observations used the project's own analysis scripts;"
" this page adds a fresh REA inspection of the same original target. The "
"supplied game's identity is pinned by its repository manifest, with "
"independent pristine-dump provenance still open."
